{"2513090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "云玩家:口口", "steam_appid": 2513090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>开发者的话</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >看到很多朋友只是简单尝试了一下就认为这是一个老虎机游戏</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >但是实际上这个游戏中老虎机只占很小一部分比重</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >大致上你可以把它们看作是巫师3中的昆特牌</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >也就是如果你有兴趣, 你也可以一直玩, 但是它不是这个故事的重点</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >后续我会想办法向这个方向改进, 可能需要更直白的告知这一点</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >这是一款反氪金主题的文字解谜游戏</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >并不是老虎机游戏 ! ! !</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >并不是老虎机游戏 ! ! !</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >并不是老虎机游戏 ! ! !</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >老虎机游戏是因为剧情需要才以这种方式存在的 ! ! !</h2></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513090/extras/700cb7bf96069acb7252ebf341d6d997.avif?t=1732405538\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >这是一个只剩下氪金游戏的未来世界<br>你将扮演一名这个时代&quot;最有前途&quot;的游戏代练<br>为偿还债务而进行各种努力</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513090/extras/8f75532839b16ba9d394dc751707d469.avif?t=1732405538\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;人人代&quot;是全球氪金委员会唯一指定代练平台<br>这里提供了数款不同类型的&quot;老虎机&quot;游戏供你选择<br>总有一款适合你的代练工作</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513090/extras/42500f60fa0279a22f75db708bd6cf8a.avif?t=1732405538\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;暗宇宙&quot;是反对氪金的人们建立起来的简陋文字世界<br>必须通过&quot;小飞机&quot;才能链接<br>在这里你可以自由探索你需要的一切</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513090/extras/40340cf6fae2ba2461b0d9faabeb136a.avif?t=1732405538\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >你可以通过安装各种&quot;插件&quot;提高你的代练能力<br>也可以通过解锁各种&quot;皮肤&quot;扩展你的探索手段<br>也可以通过解锁各种&quot;云盘&quot;提高你的战斗力<br>当然这一切都需要先解开各种类型的谜题</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513090/extras/a034672129bb72b643f521455fb5fa48.avif?t=1732405538\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >你可以打造你的专属基地<br>使用收集到的文字知识来进行建造和生产<br>各种路人,居民, 甚至是好友, 怪物都可以成为你的助力</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513090/extras/6c3626120869c0b79747ac82891a4630.avif?t=1732405538\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >这个世界没有废话<br>所有有用的信息都会被自动记录下来<br>你需要<br>辨别&quot;流言&quot;的真假<br>合理利用&quot;规则&quot;和&quot;线索&quot;<br>完成各种小&quot;目标&quot;,<br>最后还原世界的真相</h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513090/extras/700cb7bf96069acb7252ebf341d6d997.avif?t=1732405538\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >这是一个只剩下氪金游戏的未来世界<br>你将扮演一名这个时代&quot;最有前途&quot;的游戏代练<br>为偿还债务而进行各种努力</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513090/extras/8f75532839b16ba9d394dc751707d469.avif?t=1732405538\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;人人代&quot;是全球氪金委员会唯一指定代练平台<br>这里提供了数款不同类型的&quot;老虎机&quot;游戏供你选择<br>总有一款适合你的代练工作</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513090/extras/42500f60fa0279a22f75db708bd6cf8a.avif?t=1732405538\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&quot;暗宇宙&quot;是反对氪金的人们建立起来的简陋文字世界<br>必须通过&quot;小飞机&quot;才能链接<br>在这里你可以自由探索你需要的一切</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513090/extras/40340cf6fae2ba2461b0d9faabeb136a.avif?t=1732405538\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >你可以通过安装各种&quot;插件&quot;提高你的代练能力<br>也可以通过解锁各种&quot;皮肤&quot;扩展你的探索手段<br>也可以通过解锁各种&quot;云盘&quot;提高你的战斗力<br>当然这一切都需要先解开各种类型的谜题</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513090/extras/a034672129bb72b643f521455fb5fa48.avif?t=1732405538\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >你可以打造你的专属基地<br>使用收集到的文字知识来进行建造和生产<br>各种路人,居民, 甚至是好友, 怪物都可以成为你的助力</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513090/extras/6c3626120869c0b79747ac82891a4630.avif?t=1732405538\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >这个世界没有废话<br>所有有用的信息都会被自动记录下来<br>你需要<br>辨别&quot;流言&quot;的真假<br>合理利用&quot;规则&quot;和&quot;线索&quot;<br>完成各种小&quot;目标&quot;,<br>最后还原世界的真相</h2>", "short_description": "《云玩家:口口》是一款反氪金题材的文字冒险解谜游戏, 你将扮演这个荒谬的大氪金时代中&quot;最有前途&quot;的游戏代练, 在自我救赎的同时破解层层谜团, 逐步揭开这个世界的真实面纱. 现在下单免费赠送多款风格迥异的老虎机小游戏, 绝对良心!", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese", "reviews": "“是正統的文字解謎遊戲. 內容也很充足. 值得一試.好玩之處是解謎, 每次登入<span class=\"bb_spoiler\">暗宇宙</span>都可以找到新的謎題, 然後卡關-找線索-思考-破關, 解開那一下是有爽到.腦子不夠時可以返回雲字宙玩玩老虎機小遊戲, <span class=\"bb_spoiler\">暗宇宙</span>找到線索的話還可以解解成就.”<br>玩家Siman的评测<br><br>“这是一款集合了推口子、血统口验、少口换装、宠物口成、地牢探口、农口模拟、口地建设、冒口解谜等等元素的口口类跨世代&quot;大&quot;作。”<br>作者说这是一个线索<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513090/header.jpg?t=1732405538", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513090/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1732405538", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2513090/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1732405538", "website": "https://declanzhang.itch.io/yunwanjia", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.00GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX760<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> ☐口□▫☐□口▫</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["猫不在 / Cat404"], "publishers": ["猫没了 / CatNotFound"], "demos": [{"appid": 2782350, "description": ""}], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 399, "final": 399, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$3.99"}, "packages": [903560], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy 云玩家:口口", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 903560, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "云玩家 - $3.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 399}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 30, "description": "Steam Workshop"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 15, "description": "Stats"}, {"id": 25, "description": "Steam Leaderboards"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "gen